<title>USA: Avondale inks $332mln pact with ARCO Marine.</title>
<headline>Avondale inks $332mln pact with ARCO Marine.</headline>
<dateline>NEW ORLEANS 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Avondale Industries Inc said Monday it signed a $332 million contract with ARCO Marine Inc to build two crude carriers.</p>
<p>The company, which builds military and commercial ships, said the contract also provides options for three additional ships.</p>
<p>Construction is scheduled to start in December. At peak staffing levels, the program will employ about 2,200 people and delivery of the first ship is scheduled for the first quarter of 2000.  Arco expects to release design details and specifications on July 29.</p>
</text>
